FamilyTree.person({"id":"petrus_sabbe","name":"Petrus Sabbe","dates":"d. 31 Dec 1652 Oostkamp (Ruddervoorde)","confidence":"sup","surname":"Sabbe","family":"sabbe","died":"31 Dec 1652 Oostkamp (Ruddervoorde)","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bostyn-cappaert","father":"willem_sabbe_y","mother":"clara_vandeputte","spouses":[{"id":"judoca_vandenberghe","name":"Judoca Vandenberghe","detail":"Oostkamp, 11 Jun 1616"}],"source":"isavdw — Rijksarchief-sourced, with scan links","note":"Source detail: Geneanet isavdw (Rijksarchief aktes; Sosa 6760)\n\nAlso 'Schabbe'. Married Judoca Vandenberghe 1616; nine children incl. Simon Sabbe (1627). Witness at the wedding was his uncle Michiel Sabbe (b.1557). Parents Willem Sabbe x Clara Vande Putte. The Sabbe line runs back to Judocus 'Joos' Sabbe (~1475) around Harelbeke."});
